Patch: 009-web-search-live
Reason: a session may turn on Codex's own web search, live: the harness passes its webSearch option to the config, which then sets web_search = "live" (the pinned CLI offers the provider's hosted web_search tool through the session's custom provider, with no provider capability to set); off, the config is as before, and web_search stays a key a caller may not set
Upstream: ours
Pins: the config sets Codex's web search to live only when asked, and a caller still may not set web_search itself
Pins: web search live through the pinned binary: the run completes past a web_search_call, the proxy forwards the recorded live tool, and the search is booked
---
